## Success Criteria

1. `/stage0 "$500 deploy"` TIER_0 → 0 labor-only models in output. All models have ROI% metric
2. Sleep Test (Q4) is Phase 1 filter in pipeline — not Phase 6 measurement
3. Every model has: deploy_cost, roi_pct, payback_days, founder_hours_post_setup
4. Portfolio construction with 30-day kill criteria per asset
5. Quality scorer measures ROI calculation quality, not "mentions leverage"
6. Backward compat: old case JSONs still parseable (leverage fields optional, default null)

## Risks

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|-----------|
| Paradigm rewrite in 2500-line stage0.md | HIGH: easy to break existing flow | Phase 5 scoped to specific sections only |
| $500 capital can be lost in 30 days | MEDIUM: 3/5 micro-assets will die | Portfolio design expects death — kill criteria + reallocation |
| Research agents must search DIFFERENTLY | HIGH: WebSearch queries change | New search templates in stage0 spec, not hardcoded in scripts |
| Backward compat with existing 225-line case JSONs | MEDIUM | All new fields optional with null defaults |
| TIER_0 CASHFLOW_SEED subtrack still labor-first | HIGH: defeats purpose | Remove `no_product_dev: True`, replace with `deploy_allocation` |

